sequenceDiagram
  participant application as API or worker startup
  participant manifest as Addon manifests
  participant sorter as Dependency sorter
  participant orm as ORM installer
  participant database as PostgreSQL
  participant registry as Runtime registry
  application->>manifest: Load addon definitions and dependencies
  manifest->>sorter: Provide addon manifests and dependencies
  sorter->>orm: Validate and pass addons in dependency order
  orm->>database: Open transaction and acquire install lock
  orm->>database: Synchronize model schema and run versioned programmatic upgrades
  orm->>database: Apply stable external-ID seeds and addon versions
  database-->>orm: Commit installation transaction
  orm->>registry: Register models, views, and menus after commit
  registry-->>application: Expose installed addon capabilities
